This repository contains author-created source code, coefficient data, and
derived measurement tables for "Fast Matrix Multiplication in fp8: Certified
Coefficient Optimization and Measured Error". These materials are released
under the MIT License in LICENSE.

No model checkpoints, corpus text, benchmark questions, DeepGEMM source,
CUTLASS source, or other third-party software is redistributed here. The
released JSON and CSV files contain derived numerical measurements produced by
the authors. Repeating the GPU measurements requires separately obtaining the
relevant model checkpoints, WikiText-2, PyTorch, and DeepGEMM under their own
licenses.
